{"id":"d30bcf325c149afd","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-cor-minkowski-inequality.md","title":"Minkowski Inequality","display":"cor-minkowski-inequality — Minkowski Inequality","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-minkowski-inequality","aliases":["58-cor-minkowski-inequality"],"display":"cor-minkowski-inequality — Minkowski Inequality","depends_on":["[[58-df-lp-space]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-minkowski-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-minkowski-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-minkowski-inequality — Minkowski Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,p,f,g\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,p,f,g\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land[g]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land[g]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}minkowski\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\int_X|f+g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\\leq\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}+\\left(\\int_X|g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}minkowski\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\int_X|f+g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\\leq\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}+\\left(\\int_X|g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里陈述有限指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq p&lt;\\infty\">\\(1\\leq p&lt;\\infty\\)</span> 的 Minkowski 不等式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\infty\">\\(p=\\infty\\)</span> 需改用本质上确界范数。</li>\n<li>结论依赖具体测度空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>，不能只写未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lp-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land[g]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ (see [[58-df-lp-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AeClass}$ 取 [[58-df-lp-space]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,p,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land[g]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}minkowski\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land g\\in\\mathbb C^X\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\Bigr)\\to\\left(\\int_X|f+g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\\leq\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}+\\left(\\int_X|g|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}","display":true},{"tex":"1\\leq p<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false}],"bytes":1480,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-cor-minkowski-inequality.md|58-cor-minkowski-inequality]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a1d034d5d39b4a14","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}